#. ふぅ……
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Whew..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>朝食を食べても…
#. やっぱり…まだ体が重いな……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Breakfast didn't help me feel any more upbeat, that's\n"
"for sure.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>昨日の夜更かしのせい…だけじゃなさそうだ……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I feel like this is more than just me staying up late\n"
"last night...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0004 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0005 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>Rời khỏi đây?\n"
"<CLT>"

#. 舞園さんが…ここで…
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Right here is where Sayaka..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あの悪夢だけは…
#. いつまでたっても忘れられない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That's one nightmare I still can't forget, no matter\n"
"how much time passes...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この学園生活は…いつまで続くんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>How long are we going to be stuck here, living out\n"
"this school life...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんかダルい…鉄板なんかどうでもいい…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm feeling so lethargic today. Don't even care about\n"
"those metal plates...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なんかダルい…鉄板なんかどうでもいい…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm feeling so lethargic today. Don't even care about\n"
"those metal plates...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>このメモ帳…
#. 結局、舞園さんが使ったっきりだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I haven't touched this notepad since...Sayaka used it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんな…粘着テープクリーナーなんてどうでもいい…
#. 体がダルい…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This lint roller reminds me of a steamroller, paving\n"
"over my motivation...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここには…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>In here is...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>腐川さんから預かった
#. サバイバルナイフをしまったんだっけ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...the survival knife that Toko found.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0016 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0017 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>時間もあるし、少し休もうかな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I have a little time. Maybe I should get some rest...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>うぅ…なんか気分が悪い…
#. ゴミ箱に吐きそうだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Urgh... I don't feel so good. I think I might throw up\n"
"into this trash can...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0020 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0021 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0022 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>Rời khỏi đây?\n"
"<CLT>"
